license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/FrancisRVillatoro/schwarzschild-one-particle-reproducibility"
abstract: >-
  Numerical and symbolic reproducibility package supporting two related studies
  of quantum fields near the Schwarzschild spacelike singularity: the universal
  Kasner scaling limit of Hadamard states and the particle-number, terminal-state,
  and one-particle-stress analysis.
keywords:
  - Schwarzschild black hole
  - black-hole interior
  - quantum field theory in curved spacetime
  - Kasner spacetime
  - Hadamard states
  - renormalized stress-energy tensor
  - adiabatic renormalization
  - Bogoliubov transformations
  - reproducible research
